@title EPISODE 10 • HALLOWEEN AT KAPPA
@bg party_house_night
@show paris
Halloween. You and Paris go as twin angels because Mom will see the pictures. Paris's wings keep hitting people.
@show cassie
Cassie is dressed as a detective. Nobody laughs because it isn't a joke.
@show diggy
Diggy is dressed as... a sprinter. His actual uniform.
London: That's not a costume.
Diggy: I'm going as a guy who's gonna beat you in the 300 rematch.
> [Bold] "Then show me. Dance-off. Right now." -> h1
> [Sweet] Fix his crooked bib without saying anything. -> h2
> [Bitchy] "Lazy. Like your arm swing." -> h3
*h1
@add Diggy_Affection 3
@add Team_Reputation 2
The whole party circles you. He can actually dance. You can actually dance better. Nobody is going to let either of you forget it.
@jump h_done
*h2
@add Diggy_Affection 2
@add Diggy_Trust 1
His breath catches. Yours too. Someone yells "KISS" and you both step back like you got shocked.
@jump h_done
*h3
@add Diggy_Affection -1
Diggy: My arm swing is beautiful and you know it.
*h_done
@show jayden
Then you see it. Jayden in the hallway, a little too close to Suki. Suki shaking her head, trying to leave. Paris coming around the corner in three... two...
> [Good] Intercept Paris and pull her to the dance floor. -> j1
> [Bold] Walk up and tell Jayden to back off Suki. Loud. -> j2
> [Bad] Let Paris see. She deserves to know. -> j3
*j1
@add Paris_Friendship 1
@add Suki_Friendship 2
Paris spins, laughing, wings everywhere. She never sees it. You're not sure that was kind.
@jump j_done
*j2
@add Suki_Friendship 2
@add Team_Reputation 1
@add Paris_Suspicious 2
Jayden: Whoa, London, chill—
London: I am extremely chill. Go find your angel.
Paris, from behind you: "...What's going on?"
@jump j_done
*j3
@add Paris_Suspicious 3
@add Suki_Friendship -2
Paris stops. Sees. Her face doesn't break; it just closes, like a door.
*j_done
